New or changed components in Dungeon Cleaning Express v. 0.2.4.0:
- one new level;
- one new creature/enemy;
- timer for the score system;
- simple score system (for future leaderboards);
- improved graphics;
- minor changes in color palette;
- improved gameplay balance;
- simple enemy randomization - randomized type and visual presentation;
- minor improvements in game menu.
